## 1. Introduction and Scope

BrightPath Analytics supports flexible work arrangements, including work-from-home and remote work, to support employee well-being, productivity, and work-life balance. This Remote Work Policy establishes guidelines for hybrid and fully remote work arrangements.

**Policy Goals:**
- Provide flexibility while maintaining collaboration and company culture
- Ensure business continuity and customer service
- Support employee autonomy and trust
- Establish clear expectations and accountability

This policy applies to all full-time regular employees. Remote work arrangements for probationary, intern, or contract employees are determined on a case-by-case basis.

